From e7a5d6eb5a85a67c6e67fd62e6ffae69ff3dc4e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: marclawclaw <marclawclaw@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 04:46:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] poc: private account swaps against a public AMM pool in one
 tx

Adds poc_token and poc_amm test guests and state tests showing a private
account paying AAA and receiving BBB through a public pool PDA in a single
privacy-preserving transaction, via blinded aliases, with no ephemeral
public account. The proof commits only to the private/public boundary, so
the swap settles after another trade moved the pool within slippage, and
reverts cleanly beyond it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
